{{define "subject"}}{{.InviterName}} added you to {{.TeamName}} on Penny{{end}}
{{define "body"}}<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Hi {{.InviteeName}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">{{if eq .Role "parent"}}{{.InviterName}} added you to <strong>{{.TeamName}}</strong> as a parent, so you can follow your children's lessons and payments on Penny.{{else if eq .Role "student"}}{{.InviterName}} added you to <strong>{{.TeamName}}</strong> as a student, so you can see your lessons and what to work on.{{else}}{{.InviterName}} added you to <strong>{{.TeamName}}</strong> as a {{.Role}}. Penny keeps the team's lessons, timetable and payments in order.{{end}}</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;">Sign in or create an account with this email address, {{.Email}}, to see {{if eq .Role "parent"}}them{{else}}your lessons{{end}}.</p>
<p style="margin:0;"><a href="{{.SignInURL}}" style="display:inline-block;background:#1C2B3A;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:8px;">Open Penny</a></p>{{end}}
